iv><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Xayepocax\">Temple of Xayepocax</a>, below Point of No Return in <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Orc%20Cave\">Venore Orc Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">Maze of Lost Souls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulderek%27s%20Rock\">Orc Fort</a>, north west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenbane\">Elvenbane</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains Of Havoc</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tAn Orc Shaman will run when in low health.<br/><br/>An orc shaman attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUnless you're surrounded by four or more of these Orcs (in which case you just <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">GFB</a>), don't bother killing the <a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a> to avoid breaking your shielding, because an Orc Shaman attacks with unblockable Magical Damage. Kill the Orc Shaman and the Snakes will die instantly.<br/>\nShamans do not push objects, so trapping them in a corner is a good idea if they annoy you when hunting stronger creatures.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 16,306 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery